> [0.000000] [mc_explo/INFO]   #1 Actor 1 in simcall ActorCreate(child 2)
> [0.000000] [mc_explo/INFO]   #2 Actor 2 in simcall ActorExit()     <== access 1 (WRITE by actor 2) happened before this transition
> [0.000000] [mc_explo/INFO]   #3 Actor 1 in simcall ActorJoin(target 2, no timeout)     <== access 2 (WRITE by actor 1) happened before this transition
> [0.000000] [mc_explo/INFO] To see the source line of each access, rerun this execution through simgrid-mc with the same options, adding --cfg=model-check/replay:'1;2;1' (the --cfg=model-check/watch option is also useful to get more information, but I cannot tell the exact option to pass because --log=no_loc is used)
> [0.000000] [mc_dfs/INFO] DFS exploration ended. 4 unique states visited; 0 explored traces (0 transition replays, 3 states visited overall)

p The memory trace of the transition ending the segment of the thread exceeds the capacity of a socket, which must not
p block its replay
